            "status": "published",
            "owner": "Docs",
            "summary": "A short intro doc.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-getting-started-s1\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">1.0</div><h2>Welcome to Nimbus</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>Nimbus is a fictional game that ships as demo content with DocPilot. Use it to explore the reader and the admin CMS without touching real tenant data.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-success callout success\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-getting-started-s1-next\" data-variant=\"success\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Next</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>Open the <strong>Component Gallery</strong> document to see every editor element in action.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>"
          }
        ],
        "doc-nimbus-component-gallery": [
          {
            "id": "doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s1",
            "number": "1.0",
            "slug": "overview",
            "title": "Component Gallery — Overview",
            "status": "published",
            "owner": "Docs",
            "summary": "What this gallery is and how to read it.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s1\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">1.0</div><h2>Component Gallery — Overview</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>This document is a living showcase of every building block available in the DocPilot section editor. Each section below demonstrates one managed component in context, using placeholder copy for the fictional game <strong>Nimbus</strong>.</p><h3>1.1 How to use it</h3><p>Open this document in the admin editor to see how each component is authored, or read it here to see how it renders. Everything is dummy content — safe to clone, edit, or delete.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-info callout info\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s1-tip\" data-variant=\"info\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Tip</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>Duplicate this document to bootstrap a real product guide, then swap the placeholder text and images for your own.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>"
          },
          {
            "id": "doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2",
            "number": "2.0",
            "slug": "callouts",
            "title": "Callouts",
            "status": "published",
            "owner": "Docs",
            "summary": "All five callout variants.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">2.0</div><h2>Callouts</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>Callouts highlight a single idea. Five variants carry different weight:</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-info callout info\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2-info\" data-variant=\"info\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Information</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>Neutral context or a clarification.</p></div></div><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-success callout success\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2-success\" data-variant=\"success\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Success</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>A positive outcome or a confirmed-safe path.</p></div></div><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-warning callout important\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2-warning\" data-variant=\"warning\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Observed value, not a rule</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>Numbers seen in a screenshot are examples until product specs confirm them.</p></div></div><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-danger callout danger\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2-danger\" data-variant=\"danger\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Danger</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>Something that costs the player money if misunderstood.</p></div></div><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-callout doc-component-variant-note callout note\" data-doc-component=\"callout\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s2-note\" data-variant=\"note\" data-ordered=\"false\"><span class=\"callout-title doc-component-title\">Note</span><div class=\"doc-component-body\"><p>An aside or a secondary detail worth recording.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>"
          },
