            "status": "published",
            "owner": "Docs",
            "summary": "Managed bullet list.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s3\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">3.0</div><h2>Bullet List</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>A managed list keeps each item individually editable.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-list doc-component-variant-info\" data-doc-component=\"list\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s3-quick\" data-variant=\"info\" data-ordered=\"false\"><h4 class=\"doc-component-title\">Quick Reference</h4><ul><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s3-i1\">Set your stake.</li><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s3-i2\">Start the round.</li><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s3-i3\">Cash out before the round ends.</li></ul></div>\n</div></section>"
