            "summary": "Managed table with editable cells.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s4\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">4.0</div><h2>Table</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>Tables render headers and rows; each cell is editable inline.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-table doc-component-variant-info\" data-doc-component=\"table\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s4-controls\" data-variant=\"info\" data-ordered=\"false\"><h4 class=\"doc-component-title\">Control Reference</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Control</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-component-row-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s4-r1\"><td>Stake</td><td>Sets the wager.</td><td>Half / double / max shortcuts.</td></tr><tr data-component-row-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s4-r2\"><td>Start</td><td>Begins a round.</td><td>Locks the stake.</td></tr><tr data-component-row-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s4-r3\"><td>Cash Out</td><td>Takes the current multiplier.</td><td>Available until the round ends.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div></section>"
