            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s5\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">5.0</div><h2>Steps</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>Steps render as an ordered, numbered flow.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-steps doc-component-variant-success\" data-doc-component=\"steps\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s5-flow\" data-variant=\"success\" data-ordered=\"true\"><h4 class=\"doc-component-title\">Round Flow</h4><ol class=\"steps\"><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s5-st1\"><strong class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Set the stake</strong><p class=\"doc-component-item-body\">Enter an amount or use the shortcuts.</p></li><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s5-st2\"><strong class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Start the round</strong><p class=\"doc-component-item-body\">The board locks and play begins.</p></li><li data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s5-st3\"><strong class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Cash out</strong><p class=\"doc-component-item-body\">Take the multiplier before the round ends.</p></li></ol></div>\n</div></section>"
