            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s6\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">6.0</div><h2>Region List</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>A region list names the parts of a screen as term/description pairs.</p><dl class=\"doc-component doc-component-regions doc-component-variant-info ui-list\" data-doc-component=\"regions\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s6-screen\" data-variant=\"info\" data-ordered=\"false\"><dt class=\"doc-component-title\">Screen Regions</dt><div class=\"doc-region-row\" data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s6-rg1\"><dt class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Header bar</dt><dd class=\"doc-component-item-body\">Logo, clock, and balance.</dd></div><div class=\"doc-region-row\" data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s6-rg2\"><dt class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Control panel</dt><dd class=\"doc-component-item-body\">Stake, start, and cash-out controls.</dd></div><div class=\"doc-region-row\" data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s6-rg3\"><dt class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Main board</dt><dd class=\"doc-component-item-body\">The play area.</dd></div></dl>\n</div></section>"
