            "owner": "Docs",
            "summary": "Expandable FAQ accordion.",
            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s7\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">7.0</div><h2>Accordion</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>An accordion collapses long Q&amp;A into expandable rows.</p><div class=\"doc-component doc-component-accordion doc-component-variant-note\" data-doc-component=\"accordion\" data-component-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s7-faq\" data-variant=\"note\" data-ordered=\"false\"><h4 class=\"doc-component-title\">Frequently Asked</h4><details data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s7-q1\"><summary class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Can I cash out at any time?</summary><div class=\"doc-component-item-body\"><p>Yes, until the round ends.</p></div></details><details data-component-item-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s7-q2\"><summary class=\"doc-component-item-title\">Is there an auto mode?</summary><div class=\"doc-component-item-body\"><p>Yes — see the Tabs section for Manual vs Auto.</p></div></details></div>\n</div></section>"
