            "html": "<div class=\"section-banner\" id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s10\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"num\">10.0</div><h2>Figures & Markers</h2></div></div><section class=\"content\"><div class=\"container\">\n<p>A plain figure pairs an image with a caption:</p><figure class=\"figure\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Nimbus main board placeholder\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><em>The main board, shown with placeholder art.</em></figcaption></figure><p>An annotated figure overlays markers on the image, each described below it:</p><figure class=\"figure annotated-figure\"><div class=\"annotated-image\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"Default game screen with markers\"><span class=\"doc-marker marker-shape\" data-kind=\"shape\" data-marker-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s10-m1\" data-label=\"Stake\" style=\"left:18%; top:60%; width:20%; height:12%; border-color:#7aa3d6; background-color:#7aa3d6; color:#ffffff;\"><b class=\"doc-marker-chip\">Stake</b></span><span class=\"doc-marker marker-link\" data-kind=\"link\" data-marker-id=\"doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s10-m2\" data-target=\"#doc-nimbus-component-gallery-s8\" data-label=\"Modes\" style=\"left:60%; top:20%; width:22%; height:12%; border-color:#63cdff; background-color:#63cdff; color:#0b1722;\"><b class=\"doc-marker-chip\">Modes →</b></span></div><div class=\"marker-description-list\"><div class=\"marker-description\" data-marker-description-index=\"1\"><strong>Stake</strong><p>The wager input and quick controls.</p></div><div class=\"marker-description\" data-marker-description-index=\"2\"><strong>Modes</strong><p>Link marker — jumps to the Tabs section.</p></div></div><figcaption><em>Default screen with a shape marker and a link marker.</em></figcaption></figure>\n</div></section>"
